      "rationale": "The success/failure envelope, mandatory object details, separation of stderr and stdout and special export behavior are sufficiently exact to parse and snapshot. Human-readable text remains presentation freedom without weakening the machine contract.",
      "source_citations": [
        {
          "section_id": ".specs/features/008-settings-cli/spec.md:L236-L240",
          "excerpt": "Diagnostics, warnings and progress go to stderr in both modes. Export operations writing to `-` print only the exported content without `--json`, and put it in `data.content` of the envelope with `--json`."
