        {
          "section_id": ".specs/features/008-settings-cli/spec.md:L241-L245",
          "excerpt": "Error codes and exit codes are stable and documented: `usage_error` and `validation_failed`, `shortcut_conflict`, `limit_exceeded` → 2; `revision_conflict` → 3; `not_found` → 4; `unavailable` → 5; `persistence_failed` and `internal_error` → 1; success → 0."
