          "excerpt": "Every error code owned by this feature (`usage_error`, `validation_failed`, `revision_conflict`, `not_found`, `unavailable`, `persistence_failed`, `internal_error`) is produced by at least one automated test with its documented exit code; domain codes (`shortcut_conflict`, `limit_exceeded`) are tested by the features that own them."
